# Preview Screen Action Standard

- Every new expandable preview screen must follow the Maintenance Log action design.
- Place Edit and Delete together at the bottom of the expanded preview, after all preview content and footer information.
- Use the shared `PreviewActionButtons` component. Do not recreate the controls locally.
- Edit and Delete must be equal-width outlined buttons on one row.
- Edit uses `create-outline`; it is navy in light mode and white in dark mode.
- Delete uses `trash-outline` with the danger-red border, icon, and text.
- Do not place preview Edit/Delete controls in the card header.
- Hide preview editing controls while the screen is in PDF export-selection mode.
- Preserve permission checks: only pass an action callback when that user is allowed to perform it.

Reference: `ADMIN/App Design/BUTTON_TAG_STANDARD.md`.
